Dear community! The new update is already here, which means new mechanics are already available. This patch is the penultimate one before the final release. 
List of changes:
[list]
"More life for survivors." This change will only affect the Survival mode and Boss Wave. With a successful combination of circumstances, that is, when winning a victory over the boss, one life indicator will be repaired on the dashboard and one life added, provided that all active life indicators light up "green", otherwise, if the indicator is extinguished, one life will simply be added;
[/list]
[list]
"Chip integration" - now in each sector you can find a chip that is the key to access the EXTRA level, where large deposits of Darkie are stored, so successfully hidden by the boss. Activation of the chip occurs automatically and only after killing the boss, causing a space-time swirl, where you need to roll the ball, which will be the key to successful entry into the EXTRA level;
[/list]
[list]
EXTRA level, as noted earlier, is a secret place known only to the sector boss, but he will only tell you about it posthumously and then if you have the appropriate chip. Tip: use the service "Cosmo aid", so as not to lose the chip on the way to the boss! The goal at this level is to collect as many Darkie and points as possible if you want to be at the top of the ranking table;
[/list]
[list]
new game mechanics at the EXTRA level, which is why it is extra. There is no wall, which in normal situations is located opposite the platform, and forms a second out zone, which in case of activation of the “Barrier " bonus can be protected by an energy barrier. Also, on this side, for your convenience, there is a holographic impression created on the basis of your platform, which will allow you to hit the ball no less effectively. However, when creating it, something went wrong and, therefore, the movement of the platforms relative to each other is out of sync. Since the hologram was created at the start of the level, it can not take over the effects of the progenitor, but on the other hand, this is what it is good for, because it is not susceptible to receiving damage;
[/list]
[list]
"Darkie" is a valuable currency that is extracted through the destruction of heavy-duty blocks by inflicting critical damage to them. The higher the difficulty of the game, the more currency for destroying the block! For pilots with an increased appetite, we offer extra levels. Now they are accepted on the service "Cosmo help", but in the future they can be spent in the Store to get a unique and useful skin;
[/list]
[list]
Cosmo aid - the service is useful for those who want to extend their life and gaming session. Restores the standard life pack and activates available barriers before the out zone. This help will be useful for saving points, as well as the chip that opens access to the EXTRA level;
[/list]
[list]
"Freeze” - not everyone knew that the boss from SECTOR C when hitting the platform imposed a debuff that significantly reduced the speed of its movement. Now you not only know about it, but you can see this effect firsthand.
[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37565557/e1bd5c27969d47945253ea12e07e88e8051b2171.png[/img]
Other improvements in the game:

[list]
[*] updated the picture for Classic mode;
[*] updated the app icon;
[*] visual and contextual modernization of the UI and its elements;
[*] updated graphics of the ball;
[*] by default, new players start at the middle level, as befits a true Padawan, only masters in the arkanoid genre can pass the level above, but the lowest level... well, you will understand for whom it was created;
[*] added, but not all found pirate notes. However, instructions regarding survival and enrichment in the Darkanoid universe can be found when you first start Survival mode, when you detect and use the chip;
[*] added a notification about the loss of the current game progress when trying to interrupt the current game in any possible way;
[*] integrated syncing of app data in Steam, allowing you to transfer local settings and player progress to the Steam cloud;
[*] added, but not all found pirate notes. However, instructions regarding survival and enrichment in the Darkanoid universe can be found when you first start Survival mode, when you detect and use the chip;
[*] added a notification about the loss of the current game progress when trying to interrupt the current game in any possible way;
[*] integrated syncing of app data in Steam, allowing you to transfer local settings and player progress to the Steam cloud;
[*] integrated adaptive difficulty system when playing in Survival mode. The future depends on your effective game. Remember this!
[*] a new achievement “MAD MINER”is available. Farm Darkie and get this distinctive badge of honor on your chest;
[*] added tooltips that explain the many hidden mechanics of the interface and not only;
[*] added a visual effect on tiles with hidden bonuses. Now on the playing field they are marked by a running glare;
[*] added the ability to skip choreographies in the results screen;
[*] And also fixed a lot of bugs
[/list]

We hope you enjoy the upcoming changes. Follow the news!
Regards, Shezo Games Team

Dear community! It's hard to believe, but we finished off this update, which was planned to be released as they say “yesterday”. List of innovations:
[h3]Graphic elements[/h3]
Cubes have become laconic, and bonuses are readable and understandable. 

Do you remember? It's already in game!
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37565557/2af6981d9c94f090fbdf6d3ec5e4c5a4845703c4.jpg[/img]

[h3]Survival Mode[/h3]
We have included pre-announced changes such as:
- Passage of waves, each wave has its own character;
- Improved logic for generating bonuses;
- Changed block generation logic;
- boss waves;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37565557/806167b1481f148263dc3423cc94d65643be472a.png[/img]

[h3]General mechanics:[/h3]
- the keyboard control system has been abolished;
- the ball rebound from the platform into touch is canceled;
- ball collision canceled;
- reduced start time for levels;
- anti-bonuses will be less common in the Survival mode at the initial stages of the passage;

We hope you enjoy the upcoming changes. Follow the news!
Best regards, Shezo Games Team

Dear community! The work is in full swing. But for now, we have to postpone the release of the update, which was planned last week. We have made several decisions that change the way the game treats its players:
- the ball rebound is canceled, now the ball flies through the platform when bouncing off the barrier, to be honest, we ourselves are tired of this method of losing hp;
- the balls, when colliding with each other, do not change their trajectory in Casual, this always added chaos and most of the balls went out-of-bounds;
- anti-bonuses will be less common in the Survival mode at the initial stages of the passage;
- the control system from the keyboard has been abolished, since it is technically impossible to adjust the sensitivity by the force of pressing the keys;
- reduced start time for levels;
- removed collision of the ball and dips in the lateral parts of the platform, in other words, ball control has become more flexible and intuitive;

[previewyoutube=a1ia1DfFzgc;full][/previewyoutube]

The game will become more casual, and the controls will be more responsive, which will only benefit. We listen to the opinions of the players, do not hesitate to write your opinion, it is thanks to you that the game is getting better every day.
We hope you enjoy the upcoming changes. Follow the news!
Best regards, Shezo Games Team

Finally, enjoy the future changes that are waiting in the wings :)

[previewyoutube=jgsFNdh8DvU;full][/previewyoutube]

[h3]Dear community! Update 0.6.3 was released today, we have been working on it for a long time to transform the game as much as possible:
Changing graphics:[/h3]
- completely updated interface, from the main menu to the winning screen - every window has been transformed;
- the models of all bosses were replaced, and along with them energy shields were tightened, which became a single whole with the ships and visually more pleasant;
- changed the choreography of the start of the game;
- the display of points on the playing field, now you will know what affects the receipt of the maximum number of points, we will tell you about the revised points system a little below;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37565557/4ec0471dca7569b9b0f83df601cc9a082aeb7d1c.png[/img]

[h3]Changes in game mechanics:[/h3]
- scoring system, inflicting critical damage gives X2 points, the longer your effective strikes last, the more points you will be awarded;
- the speed of the ball, passing through the Teleport does not increase the speed, and effective strikes contribute to a reasonable increase in speed;
[h3]Implementation of tools for mastering the mechanics of our arkanoid:[/h3]
- a system of teaching the basic basics of the game, this system is implemented as unobtrusively as possible so that players who have already got used to it do not go through it;
- a hint system that will help players use existing tools for a more efficient passage;
[h3] Bug fixes:[/h3]
- fixed a bug in which there were restrictions on pressing the main menu button in pause mode.

 [img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37565557/7cafe87546157cd673058d4dddfb6707f4081664.gif[/img]

Best regards, Shezo Games Team

Dear community! We are improving our game and are happy to share information about the changes that are waiting for you in the next update 0.6.3:
[h3]Visual improvements: [/h3]
- new boss models. Stylish is about them;
- updated UI. Now the game looks modern;
 the choreography of the start of the level;
[h3]Implementation of tools for mastering the mechanics of our arkanoid:[/h3]
- friendly and unobtrusive training;
- hints and useful tips during the game; 
[h3]Changes to existing mechanics: [/h3]
- system for awarding points for the game. Your skill will not go unnoticed;
- platform protection. The shield will keep you alive even when you collide with blocks and drones;
- boss abilities. Only when faced with the boss, you begin to realize how harsh and dangerous space is; 

  Stay tuned!
Regards, Shezo Games.

[h3][i]Dear community! 
11.08. the long-awaited update 0.6.1 will take place, which will include:[/i][/h3]
  [h3]Additions and changes affecting the atmosphere of the game:[/h3]
[list]
[*]integrated exclusive musical accompaniment;
[*]added sound and visual effects and changed some existing ones;
[*]PC game controls have become much easier - you can enjoy the game with "Mouse only". Left mouse button for launching ball and shooting with guns, right button for the Shield;
[*]shooting or Shield activation is performed automatically by holding down the corresponding key;
[*]corrected the balance of some levels, platforms and Bosses;
[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37565557/2df9124492175ff50846d7dcb9599d369b79aee3.gif[/img]
[h3]  List of changes in game mechanics:[/h3]
[list]
[*]improved logic of falling cubes;
[*]added logic for automatic launch of drones;
[*]fixed the logic of a group of moving cubes;
[*]improved logic of Teleport cube;
[*]the ball speed control system was introduced - the ball speed directly depends on the efficiency of the game;
[*]introduced logic of changing ball spinning chance depending of its movement speed;
[*]an unique ability "Anti-gravity field" has been added to the second episode boss. The field repulse ball;
[*]for the collision of the ball with the walls, platform and barrier, score points are no longer granted;
[*]removed the limitation of balls on the game’s field. “3 Balls” bonus activation creates two extra balls.
[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37565557/c78085a93e801839ba49c4016d807fff28ea0336.gif[/img]
[h3]  Many bugs fixed including:[/h3]
[list]
[*]the bonuses “Field stop” and “Field slowdown” did not work together;
[*]desynchronization of the visual and logical phases of the flickering cube;
[*]erratic behavior of clamped cubes in a group;
[*]the ball gets stuck between the cubes;
[*]the problem with choosing a game controller.
[/list]
        We continue to develop the game, implementing new and improving the current game mechanics, tuning the levels for your comfortable game. An updated UI and a new scoring system are coming soon.
        Enjoy your game!
